      "source": [
        "# Neural Feature Exploration - PyWaveClus Enhanced\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook uses modular components for clean, maintainable neural feature analysis with **PyWaveClus spike detection**.\n",
        "\n",
        "## 🏗️ Modular Architecture:\n",
        "- **`utils/diagnostics.py`** - Data structure analysis and validation\n",
        "- **`utils/analysis.py`** - Feature extraction and analysis functions  \n",
        "- **`utils/visualization.py`** - All plotting and visualization functions\n",
        "- **`utils/spike_detection.py`** - Advanced PyWaveClus spike detection\n",
        "- **`neural_feature_extraction.py`** - Core feature extraction engine\n",
        "\n",
        "## 🎯 Benefits:\n",
        "- **Clean notebook** - Focus on analysis, not implementation details\n",
        "- **Superior spike detection** - PyWaveClus algorithm for better accuracy\n",
        "- **Reusable components** - Functions work across different datasets\n",
        "- **Easy maintenance** - Update functionality in modules, not notebooks\n",
        "- **Better testing** - Test modules independently\n"
      ]
    }
  ],
